    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements:</strong> Training (1) in Diplomacy</p><p>Your soothing words and natural empathy allow you to calm others when things grow tense.</p><ul><li><p>You have <strong>Advantage</strong> on <strong>Diplomacy</strong> checks to resolve a conflict or get your way in an argument, <strong>Perception</strong> checks to gauge other people's moods, and <strong>Investigation</strong> checks to tell if someone is lying.</p></li><li><p>Most people will act courteously, even if they don’t particularly like you.</p></li></ul>",
